      "value": "@{5b0d59b48096a127bde0735b|full_name}: This is correct.\nIt might be a good idea to have guidelines for volumes, but as with everything with world creation, it's up to the skill and taste of the creator. You can't account for everything, that's why community labs exists, as a filter for the crap.\n\nAlmost every game/application I install requires me to turn the volume down from the default 100% also.\n\nComplaining the volume is too loud when set to it's maximum is a bit strange.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
