      "value": "@{5b8059dd44451c40bfea25b3|full_name}: There's a big difference between \"I have to lower the audio to comfortably hold a conversation\" and \"Oh god my ears\".  The later being the problem I want to be solved.\n\nCurrently with the report world options there is no way to report worlds that might be completely acceptable in every other aspect, besides audio. Those worlds won't be filtered out if I cannot properly report them and have VRchat know exactly why the world is troublesome.\n\nIf some kind of tech that would normalize audio levels were to be introduced that would be even better, but if I don't bring this up then we can't have a dialogue on what solutions might be better. So I don't agree it's strange to complain about this at all - audio is important.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
