      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat Audio, Unity Audio and the Audio Itself .... you have to take account for all 3 ..... no matter what SDK you have....\nand even Then...\nIt may be loud for one user at 100% but then it may be perfect for another person at 100%.....better yet perfect to the creator....\nAdjust your System to a Generic settings >.> dont just leave it at 100% in your windows settings, and boosted 50% at speakers or headset with VRChat at 100% \nHaving an Vol Slider in the World is a Courtesy Slider. Since many dont seem to know that they have a vol slider in their setting. \n.....im sure im gonna get ranted for this XD .... but it is true",
