  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-08T12:11:12.122Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you currently go visit any random VRC world and you have your ingame audio set to 100%, more likely than not you're going to have your eardrums ruptured.\nI would honestly like to see VRchat start to take more aggressive action against worlds like that and give users the option to specifically report for that reason alone.\n\nI think it's unacceptable you're practically expected at this point to have your audio set to ~15% to simply not go deaf and I believe adding this report option will make world authors more mindful of setting proper audio levels.",
